From 28e4104d635aff96c506d2b5b7c7c7eaa17c820c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lyanteo <lyanteo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:42:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: add Tianma NT36672C panel for Xiaomi POCO X3 Pro
 (vayu)

Init sequence, 1080x2400@120 video-mode timings and DSC 1.1 parameters
(slice 540x20, 8 bpc, 8 bpp) taken from the vendor device tree
(dsi-panel-j20s-36-02-0a-lcd-dsc-vid.dtsi).

Add sm8150-xiaomi-vayu-tianma.dts which enables MDSS/DSI0, the panel and
PM8150L WLED backlight. LAB/IBB (PM8150L LCDB) have no mainline driver
yet and are left as configured by the bootloader.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
